---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="关于 - cuicui'Blog" description="关于 cuicui 与这个自留地">
  <div class="max-w-3xl">
    <!-- Header Card -->
    <div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl p-8 sm:p-10 mb-10 bg-gradient-to-br from-indigo-50/80 via-sky-50/40 to-purple-50/50 dark:from-indigo-950/30 dark:via-slate-900/50 dark:to-purple-950/20 border border-indigo-100/80 dark:border-indigo-900/50 shadow-xs">
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center gap-6">
        <img
          src="/avatar.jpg"
          alt="cuicui"
          class="w-20 h-20 rounded-2xl object-cover ring-4 ring-white/80 dark:ring-slate-800/80 shadow-md"
        />
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 font-mono">
              cuicui
            </h1>
            <span class="inline-flex items-center px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full text-xs font-medium bg-indigo-50 dark:bg-indigo-950/50 text-indigo-700 dark:text-indigo-300 border border-indigo-200/80 dark:border-indigo-800/60">
              Explorer
            </span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm font-mono text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 mt-1">
            探寻技术、工具与个人秩序的平衡点
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Content -->
    <div class="space-y-8 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">
      <blockquote class="rounded-2xl bg-white/60 dark:bg-slate-900/50 border-l-4 border-indigo-500 p-5 text-sm sm:text-base italic text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 shadow-2xs">
        “弱小和无知从不是生存的障碍，傲慢才是。” —— 《三体》
      </blockquote>

      <section class="space-y-3 p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-3xl bg-white/60 dark:bg-slate-900/40 border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800/80 shadow-xs">
        <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 font-mono flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-500"></span>
          关于这里 / About The Garden
        </h2>
        <p>
          这是我的个人博客与数字花园。早年在这里记录过很多探索代码的笔记，如今它依然是我整理思路、沉淀实践经验与记录思考的自留地。
        </p>
        <p>
          我相信工具应当简洁实用，认知应当保持开放。在快速变化的技术浪潮中，保持好奇心、专注解决实际问题比追逐标签更具生命力。
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3 p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-3xl bg-white/60 dark:bg-slate-900/40 border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800/80 shadow-xs">
        <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 font-mono flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-sky-500"></span>
          技术演进
        </h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
          本站最初基于 Hexo 构建，现已全面重构升级至现代化的 Astro 架构。页面拥有极速纯静态零运行时开销，去除了沉闷与单调，融入了柔和的轻色调视觉体系。
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3 p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-3xl bg-white/60 dark:bg-slate-900/40 border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800/80 shadow-xs">
        <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 font-mono flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>
          连接与订阅
        </h2>
        <ul class="space-y-2.5 text-sm font-mono">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-slate-400">GitHub:</span>
            <a
              href="https://github.com/cuicui-V5"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400 hover:underline"
            >
              @cuicui-V5
            </a>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-slate-400">RSS 订阅:</span>
            <a
              href="/rss.xml"
              class="text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400 hover:underline"
            >
              /rss.xml
            </a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
